From e9e4fa49bfd683e49d983d77497203414e42eeca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chedy Souffargi <cs@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 12:54:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] boards: krimx95: expose PMIC fault journal over SCMI control

- brd_sm_control SCMI redirect
- BASEPRI lock around journal reads
- zero-only clear prevents evidence loss
- LMM_MiscControlEvent from ISR
- config_scmi ctrlPerms ALL
- krimx95.cfg BRD_SM_CTRL_PMIC_FAULT

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific]
